{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WELCOME TO SUPER BLOWFISH CASTLE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Maximize your skills and test your patience as you guide a small blowfish back to its castle through a bunch of crazy obstacles. The only thing you have to do is press one button. It's pretty much a cutesy mixture of <i>Super Monkey Ball</i> and <i>Getting Over It with Bennet Foddy</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 100 levels full of   colorful mechanics\u00a0and challenging puzzles where timing is everything. Roll, skip and bounce your way to earn stars and unlock accessories to customize your blowfish and even the room around you for even more craziness.<br> It's hyper-casual, cozy, chaotic fun but trust me, it's not as easy as it looks. Think you can handle it?<br><br>This game is currently available for Windows only and will be released on android mobile devices soon. (Mac and iOS are TBA) You can find this game both here on steam and Itch.io with an Epic Game Store release also coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEYBOARD CONTROLS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Spacebar</strong></i> - To Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>'R' Key</strong></i> - To restart the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape</strong> - To Pause</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Long Way Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429460/23e940e27231af4bcff75ab8326ef019571f3d32.jpg"},{"name":"Try Try Again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429460/f36e7792d46224f0cb8ee305b4f4637c03cc0456.jpg"},{"name":"Try Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429460/946364b74f623920a3cd0c76d34d25912b828f0a.jpg"},{"name":"Try Harder","path":"https://cdn.aka